"enabled that option during installation. In that case, it's template is "
"``default-dvm``, but that is also the template for disposables that launch "
"applications which you don't trust. It would be improper to write the Wi-Fi "
"password to ``default-dvm``, as it would expose it to numerous qubes. "
"Instead, write the data as a qube feature using the :samp:`vm-config.{X}` "
"syntax, where :samp:`{X}` is any valid identification string you'd like."
msgstr ""

